{"4872140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sydwater", "steam_appid": 4872140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4971640], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/338f0c44c3bd79464d58a520a722bf56.avif?t=1784957649\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras_big/338f0c44c3bd79464d58a520a722bf56.avif?t=1784957649 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sydwater is a wide open world to explore and conquer from the reign of the Wicked Badmen. There are many areas in Sydwater from Springwood to the Opera House, along with many iconic Australian landmarks to explore and liberate from the hands of the Wicked Badmen,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wicked Badmen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/bf8d52ecd558cfa78a8c2080915e96a3.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/bf8d52ecd558cfa78a8c2080915e96a3.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/bf8d52ecd558cfa78a8c2080915e96a3.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sydwater there are many different enemy types. Each enemy offers a different combat experience and will make the player choose different playstyles for the different situations they find themselves in. Whether that be blasting fools with shotguns or sniping a Deadeye to even the playing field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat with Physics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b7353ab13608ae7c83c2046c420df5f2.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b7353ab13608ae7c83c2046c420df5f2.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b7353ab13608ae7c83c2046c420df5f2.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Sydwater is Physics Based meaning each shotgun blast and every ping with the rifle has a different impact on the different enemy types and enables the enemies ragdoll with Unreal Engine physics. With many different weapons and combat encounters to find in the world the Player can have fun sending Wicked Badmen flying or silently casting fire spells on them from a distance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/687814b9bbcb0b4c73f20279cec1926d.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/687814b9bbcb0b4c73f20279cec1926d.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/687814b9bbcb0b4c73f20279cec1926d.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sydwater has many vehicles all over the world, discover different cars while playing and use them to traverse the open world, you can also run people over at high speeds and see how far you can send their bodies flying. There are many different vehicles including: Pirate Ship, Cop Car, Train and even a Carriage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permadeath</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/089468c6fd29df284c0ca0ee49ee62bf.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/089468c6fd29df284c0ca0ee49ee62bf.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/089468c6fd29df284c0ca0ee49ee62bf.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sydwater the Player can easily send many Wicked Badmen to the grave, however, if the player gets sent to the grave themselves it is a permanent death, meaning the player can not continue that run of the game, they will have to respawn or restart the game to continue the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magical Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cc27ebc0c1c003c964573d612325dc51.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cc27ebc0c1c003c964573d612325dc51.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cc27ebc0c1c003c964573d612325dc51.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Powers have been granted to the Player by the Master Wizard of the land. Blink Teleport allows the player to teleport forward where they are aiming and Sloth Sense is the ability to slow time for bullet time precision. The player can even hire his best friend The Master Wizard Slorath to cast the spells for him later in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spawn System<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/34511a1e586318aa5002e54ad6fdefb0.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/34511a1e586318aa5002e54ad6fdefb0.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/34511a1e586318aa5002e54ad6fdefb0.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Player is given a Spawn Menu, which allows them to set their spawn anywhere in the world, wherever they choose. The world respawns with the player so each spawn point you choose offers a different experience depending on where the player chooses. Player homes are also available offering cash and guns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend Friends<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All throughout Sydwater, the Player can find many different friendly plushies and can befriend them and let them rest on your back, helping you navigate the world and meet the different characters that can be found in the game. The player can find many unique characters including Detectives, Witches, Wizards and Cold Blooded Reptiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customisation<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Player can choose from a range of different friendly costumes in the game and also Wicked Badmen characters, the Player is encouraged to play around and find their perfect style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-Game Achievements<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a bunch of Achievements to hunt in Sydwater. From spawning in friends to sending souls to the grave. The Achievements are built into the game meaning that the player can easily find them and they will respawn with the Player each run. There are also hidden Achievements and a Platinum Achievement all built into the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Dimensions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 3 different dimensions in Sydwater. Most notably the 7th and 9th Dimensions. The 9th dimension is home to our Zombie Mode where the player can track their zombie kills and rack up the Alms counter, the 6th dimension is home to Zombies and Wicked Badmen while the 7th dimension is the home dimension with just the Wicked Badmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/e8284a5670dff203adc97ef06b3a5827.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sydwater is solo-developed and was all learnt from various online guides and tutorials, it is still the first game developed by Hazey Games, it has been optimized as thoroughly as possible while still maintaining core gameplay components. On Recommended hardware the game plays at a steady 30FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/338f0c44c3bd79464d58a520a722bf56.avif?t=1784957649\" data-big-src=http