0/extras/34511a1e586318aa5002e54ad6fdefb0.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/34511a1e586318aa5002e54ad6fdefb0.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Player is given a Spawn Menu, which allows them to set their spawn anywhere in the world, wherever they choose. The world respawns with the player so each spawn point you choose offers a different experience depending on where the player chooses. Player homes are also available offering cash and guns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend Friends<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/b05a36af1f572a1eab152ae0ba67199b.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All throughout Sydwater, the Player can find many different friendly plushies and can befriend them and let them rest on your back, helping you navigate the world and meet the different characters that can be found in the game. The player can find many unique characters including Detectives, Witches, Wizards and Cold Blooded Reptiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customisation<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/38a79bb620ef3a92a382c17df2e8f6b6.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Player can choose from a range of different friendly costumes in the game and also Wicked Badmen characters, the Player is encouraged to play around and find their perfect style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-Game Achievements<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/a5dd2ccbd24194549588ed317c49a979.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a bunch of Achievements to hunt in Sydwater. From spawning in friends to sending souls to the grave. The Achievements are built into the game meaning that the player can easily find them and they will respawn with the Player each run. There are also hidden Achievements and a Platinum Achievement all built into the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Dimensions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.poster.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.webm?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/cfd224d878bad51488cc70436bf1adc5.mp4?t=1784957649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 3 different dimensions in Sydwater. Most notably the 7th and 9th Dimensions. The 9th dimension is home to our Zombie Mode where the player can track their zombie kills and rack up the Alms counter, the 6th dimension is home to Zombies and Wicked Badmen while the 7th dimension is the home dimension with just the Wicked Badmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/extras/e8284a5670dff203adc97ef06b3a5827.avif?t=1784957649\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sydwater is solo-developed and was all learnt from various online guides and tutorials, it is still the first game developed by Hazey Games, it has been optimized as thoroughly as possible while still maintaining core gameplay components. On Recommended hardware the game plays at a steady 30FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Sydwater, a wide open TPS/FPS sandbox set in a stylized Sydney Australia inspired by the golden age of open world games. Conquer the World and play Activities to get Alms and make friends along the way. The Player can Shoot, Fly, Skate, Tag and traverse to other Dimensions.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/b26dcb6cbe2a2b68800373abe8f345b3dde62dd5/header.jpg?t=1784957649", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872140/ff74ea1c5e980c8109122f00399692b090683653/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784957649", "capsule_i